# Build context for the root Dockerfile, which needs only marketing/,
# frontend/ and deploy/. Railway builds from a clean checkout, so this mainly
# keeps a local `docker build` from shipping node_modules, build output, or a
# developer's .env files into the context.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
.git
backend
docs
memory
monitoring
test_reports
shared
